Task 1 Completed | Graphic Design Internship
Sharing my first design task from my Graphic Design Internship at SkillCraft Technology.
For this task, I created a digital awareness poster based on the message: “Pause. Think. Post.”
The idea behind the poster is simple: every post, comment, or share leaves a digital footprint. Before sharing something online, it is important to ask:

✓ Is it true?
✓ Is it kind?
✓ Is it safe?

Through this project, I worked on creating a clear visual hierarchy using bold typography, contrast, icons, and a dark digital-themed layout. My goal was to make the message easy to notice, understand, and remember.
This task gave me a chance to combine creativity with an awareness message that matters in today’s online world.
Tools used: Canva and Freepik
